counterfactuals.output:
**1. A reservation management device for a battery-swapping charging station, the device comprising:**

a communication interface configured to receive a reservation request specifying a requested number of battery packs;

a memory configured to store inventory information indicating a number of battery packs available for dispensing at the battery-swapping charging station and return information indicating a number of battery packs expected to be returned to the battery-swapping charging station; and

at least one processor configured to:

determine a projected number of battery packs available for the reservation based at least on the number of battery packs available for dispensing and the number of battery packs expected to be returned;

compare the projected number of battery packs with the requested number of battery packs;

determine that the reservation is available when the projected number of battery packs is equal to or greater than the requested number of battery packs; and

cause, via the communication interface, an indication of the determined reservation availability to be transmitted in response to the reservation request.
